# Build output for AR-0's Android rig. None of this belongs in the repository.
#
# libgojni.so is ~17 MB and the debug APK ~32 MB, and both are regenerated by
# `gomobile bind` + `gradle assembleDebug` from sources that ARE tracked. A
# binary that changes on every build is the worst possible thing to version:
# it never merges, it never diffs, and it never stops growing the history.
#
# What IS tracked: quietcore/*.go, host/**/src, the Gradle build scripts and
# the manifest — everything needed to rebuild the rig from nothing.
host/.gradle/
host/build/
host/app/build/
host/local.properties

# The AAR and its sources jar are gomobile OUTPUT, not a checked-in dependency:
# app/build.gradle.kts reads them from here, and they are produced by
#   cd android/quietcore && gomobile bind -target=android/arm64 \
#       -androidapi 24 -javapkg space.quiet -o ../host/app/libs/quietcore.aar .
host/app/libs/*.aar
host/app/libs/*-sources.jar
